    " #  logarithmic transformation\n",
    "1/Reducing the heteroscedasticity of errors: In regression models,\n",
    " logarithms help to keep the variance of errors constant.\n",
    "\n",
    "2/Dealing with financial data: Such as income or house prices,\n",
    "where there are huge gaps between the wealthy and the rest of society.\n",
    "\n",
    "3/Transforming exponential relationships into linear ones: If the relationship between variables is multiplicative, \n",
    " logarithms transform it into an associative relationship that is easier for models to understand."
   ]
